{"LID": 64, "STAGE": 3, "TITLE": "Wish & If only", "TITLE_AR": "التمنّي والندم: Wish و If only", "TIMER": 75, "XP": 50, "FULL_HTML": "\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.9;color:#1e293b\">\n\n<h1 style=\"color:#4f46e5;border-bottom:3px solid #4f46e5;padding-bottom:10px\">🎯 الدرس 19: التمنّي والندم — Wish & If only</h1>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eff6ff;border-right:5px solid #3b82f6;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin:18px 0\">\n<h2 style=\"color:#1d4ed8;margin-bottom:8px\">📌 الهدف من الدرس</h2>\n<p>في نهاية هذا الدرس ستكون قادراً على:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>التعبير عن <b>تمنّي حاضر</b> مستحيل (I wish I were rich).</li>\n<li>التعبير عن <b>ندم على ماضٍ</b> (I wish I had studied).</li>\n<li>التعبير عن <b>تذمّر من عادة مزعجة</b> (I wish you wouldn't smoke).</li>\n<li>استخدام <b>If only</b> كبديل أقوى من Wish.</li>\n<li>تجنّب أخطاء الزمن الشائعة عند المتعلم العربي.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🔑 القاعدة الذهبية</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#fef3c7;border:2px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin:14px 0\">\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:600\">عند استخدام <b>Wish</b> أو <b>If only</b>:</p>\n<p>👈 ارجع بالزمن خطوة واحدة للوراء:</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fde68a\"><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">المعنى الحقيقي</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">زمن Wish</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">حاضر (Present)</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\"><b>Past Simple</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">ماضٍ (Past)</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\"><b>Past Perfect</b> (had + V3)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">مستقبل/عادة</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\"><b>would + V1</b></td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#059669;margin-top:24px\">📚 الحالات الستّ بالتفصيل</h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">1️⃣ تمنّي حاضر مستحيل — Wish + Past Simple</h3>\n<p>تستخدم عندما تتمنّى لو كان الواقع الحالي مختلفاً:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>I wish I <b>knew</b> the answer. (لكنني لا أعرفها الآن)</li>\n<li>She wishes she <b>had</b> a car. (لكنها لا تملك واحدة)</li>\n<li>I wish I <b>were</b> taller. (ملاحظة: نستخدم <b>were</b> لكل الضمائر في الإنجليزية الرسمية)</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"background:#dbeafe;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin:10px 0\">\n<b>💡 ملاحظة ذهبية:</b> في الإنجليزية الرسمية والاختبارات: <b>I/he/she/it were</b> (وليس was). في الكلام اليومي يقبل was أيضاً.\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">2️⃣ الندم على ماضٍ — Wish + Past Perfect</h3>\n<p>تستخدم للندم على شيء حدث أو لم يحدث في الماضي:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>I wish I <b>had studied</b> harder. (الواقع: لم أدرس بجدّ، وأندم الآن)</li>\n<li>He wishes he <b>hadn't said</b> that. (الواقع: قال شيئاً ويندم)</li>\n<li>We wish we <b>had bought</b> the house. (الواقع: لم نشترِ، ونتمنّى لو فعلنا)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">3️⃣ تذمّر من عادة مزعجة — Wish + Would + V1</h3>\n<p>تستخدم للتذمّر من عادة شخص آخر أو رغبة في تغيير سلوك:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>I wish you <b>wouldn't talk</b> so loudly. (تتذمّر من عادته)</li>\n<li>I wish it <b>would stop</b> raining. (تتمنّى تغيّر المطر)</li>\n<li>She wishes her brother <b>would clean</b> his room. (تذمّر من فوضى أخيها)</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"background:#fee2e2;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin:10px 0;border-right:4px solid #dc2626\">\n<b>⚠️ تحذير حاسم:</b> لا تستخدم <b>wish + would</b> مع <b>نفسك</b>! خطأ: <s>I wish I would study</s>. الصحيح: I wish I <b>studied</b> more.\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">4️⃣ If only — صيغة أقوى من Wish</h3>\n<p><b>If only</b> تعبّر عن نفس المعاني لكن بشكل أقوى عاطفياً (أقرب للحسرة):</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0\">\n<tr style=\"background:#ddd6fe\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">Wish</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">If only (أقوى)</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">I wish I knew her name.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">If only I knew her name!</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">I wish I had told him.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">If only I had told him!</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">I wish you would listen.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #8b5cf6\">If only you would listen!</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">5️⃣ Hope vs Wish — لا تخلط!</h3>\n<div style=\"background:#fef9c3;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border-right:4px solid #eab308;margin:10px 0\">\n<p><b>Hope:</b> للمستقبل المحتمل أو الممكن. (تستخدم زمناً عادياً)</p>\n<p>✅ I <b>hope</b> you <b>pass</b> the exam. (محتمل أن ينجح)</p>\n<p><b>Wish:</b> للمستحيل أو المستبعد. (تستخدم زمناً مقلوباً)</p>\n<p>✅ I <b>wish</b> I <b>could</b> fly. (مستحيل)</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">6️⃣ Wish + Could (قدرة مستحيلة)</h3>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>I wish I <b>could speak</b> French. (لا أستطيع الآن)</li>\n<li>She wishes she <b>could have come</b>. (ندم على عدم القدرة في الماضي)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🎯 Mini-Drill — تمرين سريع</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e8ff;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;margin:14px 0\">\n<p>أكمل الفراغ بالشكل الصحيح:</p>\n<ol style=\"padding-right:24px\">\n<li>I wish I _____ (be) at the beach now. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>were</b></span></li>\n<li>She wishes she _____ (study) medicine years ago. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>had studied</b></span></li>\n<li>I wish my neighbors _____ (stop) playing loud music. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>would stop</b></span></li>\n<li>If only I _____ (know) the truth back then! → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>had known</b></span></li>\n<li>I _____ (hope/wish) you have a great trip tomorrow! → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>hope</b></span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">⚠️ الأخطاء العشرة الشائعة للمتعلم العربي</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fecaca\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">❌ خطأ شائع</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">✅ الصواب</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">السبب</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish I <s>am</s> rich.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish I <b>were</b> rich.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Wish يتطلب past</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish I <s>study</s> harder yesterday.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish I <b>had studied</b>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">ندم ماضٍ = had + V3</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish I <s>would study</s> more.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish I <b>studied</b> more.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">would لا تُستخدم مع I/we مع wish</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish you <s>will come</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish you <b>would come</b>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">مستقبل مع wish = would</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I <s>wish</s> you pass tomorrow.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I <b>hope</b> you pass.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">مستقبل ممكن = hope</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">If only I <s>have</s> more time.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">If only I <b>had</b> more time.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">If only = نفس قواعد wish</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish I <s>can</s> swim.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish I <b>could</b> swim.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">can → could بعد wish</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">She wishes she <s>didn't go</s> there last week.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">She wishes she <b>hadn't gone</b>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">ندم ماضٍ صريح</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish him <s>to come</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I wish he <b>would come</b>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">wish لا تأخذ مفعول + to</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">If only <s>that</s> I knew!</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">If only I <b>knew</b>!</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">بدون that بعد if only</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🧠 حِيَل الذاكرة</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#dcfce7;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-right:4px solid #16a34a;margin:10px 0\">\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"الخطوة للوراء\":</b> كل ما يأتي بعد wish يرجع زمناً واحداً للوراء عن الواقع.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"were للجميع\":</b> مع wish استخدم <b>were</b> مع كل الضمائر في الاختبارات.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"would للآخرين\":</b> wish + would فقط مع شخص <b>غيرك</b>، لتذمّر أو طلب تغيير.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"had-had-had\":</b> كل ندم على الماضي = had + V3 (had studied, had gone, had told).</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">📊 Quick Recap — الملخص النهائي</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#1e40af;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">الحالة</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">الصيغة</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">تمنّي حاضر</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">wish + past simple</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">I wish I knew.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">ندم ماضٍ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">wish + past perfect</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">I wish I had known.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">تذمّر/مستقبل</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">wish + would + V1</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">I wish you would call.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">قدرة مستحيلة</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">wish + could + V1</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">I wish I could fly.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">مستقبل ممكن</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">hope + present/will</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">I hope you pass.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">حسرة قوية</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">if only + (نفس قواعد wish)</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">If only I had listened!</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\"><h2 style=\"color:#4f46e5;border-bottom:2px solid #4f46e5;padding-bottom:6px\">📖 أمثلة تطبيقية (15)</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\"><tr style=\"background:#4f46e5;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">#</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">English</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">العربية</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">القاعدة</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">1</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I wish I were on vacation right now.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أتمنّى لو كنت في إجازة الآن.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">تمنّي حاضر مستحيل: wish + were</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">2</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">She wishes she had finished her homework last night.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">تتمنّى لو أنّها أنهت واجبها ليلة أمس.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">ندم ماضٍ: wish + had + V3</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">3</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I wish my brother would stop borrowing my clothes.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أتمنّى لو يتوقّف أخي عن استعارة ملابسي.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">تذمّر من عادة: wish + would + V1</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">4</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">If only I had studied harder for the test!</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">ليتني درست بجدٍّ أكبر للاختبار!</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">حسرة على ماضٍ: if only + had + V3</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">5</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I hope you have a wonderful birthday tomorrow.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أتمنّى لك عيد ميلاد رائعاً غداً.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">مستقبل ممكن: hope (وليس wish)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">6</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">He wishes he could speak Arabic fluently.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">يتمنّى لو كان يستطيع التحدّث بالعربية بطلاقة.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">قدرة مستحيلة: wish + could</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">7</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I wish it would stop raining so we could go out.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أتمنّى لو يتوقّف المطر لنخرج.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">تمنّي تغيير مستقبلي: wish + would</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">8</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">If only I knew the answer to this question!</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">ليتني أعرف إجابة هذا السؤال!</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">تمنّي حاضر بصيغة قوية: if only + past</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">9</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">We wish we hadn't sold our old house.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">نتمنّى لو أنّنا لم نبع منزلنا القديم.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">ندم ماضٍ منفي: hadn't + V3</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">10</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">My mother wishes I would call her more often.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">تتمنّى أمّي لو أتّصل بها أكثر.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">wish + would مع شخص آخر</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">11</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I wish I had a million dollars.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أتمنّى لو أملك مليون دولار.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">تمنّي حاضر: wish + had (past simple of have)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">12</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">If only she had told me the truth from the beginning.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">ليتها قالت لي الحقيقة من البداية.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">حسرة على فعل ماضٍ لم يحدث</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">13</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I wish people wouldn't litter in the park.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أتمنّى لو لا يرمي الناس النفايات في الحديقة.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">تذمّر عام: wouldn't + V1</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">14</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">She wishes she could have attended the conference.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">تتمنّى لو كانت قادرة على حضور المؤتمر.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">ندم على عدم قدرة في الماضي: could have + V3</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">15</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I hope my friend recovers quickly from his illness.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أتمنّى أن يتعافى صديقي بسرعة من مرضه.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">تمنّي مستقبلي ممكن: hope (الواقع غير مستحيل)</td></tr></table></div>\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\"><h2 style=\"color:#059669;border-bottom:2px solid #059669;padding-bottom:6px\">📚 المفردات الأساسية (18)</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\"><tr style=\"background:#059669;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">الكلمة</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">النطق IPA</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">الترجمة</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">مثال</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">wish</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/wɪʃ/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يتمنّى</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I wish I were taller.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">regret</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/rɪˈɡrɛt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يندم</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I regret not studying harder.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">hope</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/hoʊp/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يأمل</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I hope you pass the exam.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">if only</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪf ˈoʊnli/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ليت / لو فقط</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">If only I had more time!</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">imagine</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪˈmædʒɪn/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يتخيّل</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Imagine if we won the lottery.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">fortunate</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈfɔːrtʃənət/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">محظوظ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I'm fortunate to have such friends.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">unfortunate</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ʌnˈfɔːrtʃənət/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">غير محظوظ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">It's unfortunate that he missed it.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">longing</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈlɔːŋɪŋ/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">اشتياق شديد</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">She has a longing for her homeland.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">desire</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/dɪˈzaɪər/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">رغبة</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">His desire to succeed is strong.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">dream of</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/driːm əv/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يحلم بـ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I dream of becoming a doctor.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">miss out on</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/mɪs aʊt ɒn/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يفوّت فرصة</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Don't miss out on this offer!</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">settle for</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈsɛtl fɔːr/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يقنع/يرضى بـ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Don't settle for less than you deserve.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">yearn</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/jɜːrn/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يتوق</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">He yearns to see his family.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">nostalgia</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/nɒˈstældʒə/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">حنين للماضي</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">She felt nostalgia for her childhood.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">remorse</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/rɪˈmɔːrs/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ندم شديد</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">He felt deep remorse for his actions.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">hindsight</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈhaɪndsaɪt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">إدراك متأخّر</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">In hindsight, I should have said no.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">wishful thinking</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈwɪʃfəl ˈθɪŋkɪŋ/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">تفكير تمنّوي</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Believing he'll change is wishful thinking.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">missed opportunity</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/mɪst ˌɑːpərˈtuːnəti/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">فرصة ضائعة</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">That job was a missed opportunity.</td></tr></table></div>"}